<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel bank talks advance - source.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel bank talks advance - source.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc is currently negotiating with its bank lenders and the talks are progressing, a source close to the discussions said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The negotiations are advancing and the positions are getting closer,&quot; the source told Reuters.</p>
</text>
